{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/i18n/","title":"Type-safe i18n","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"type-safe-i18n","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Type-safe i18n"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/i18n"},{"t":"text","text":" is the CraftTS i18n integration. The catalogue remains a plain"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"declarative TypeScript value, while DI-aware tokens use the existing CraftTS"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"service contracts. A catalogue that does not use DI can still be formatted by"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"runtime.t"},{"t":"text","text":"; a catalogue with DI is rendered through the reactive CraftTS"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"translator so its dependencies are checked like component dependencies."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"the-contract","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The contract"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Six things are guaranteed, and all six are checked before the app runs."}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","text":"guarantee"}],[{"t":"text","text":"what it costs you to break"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"text","text":"the key set is a "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"closed union"}]},{"t":"text","text":""}],[{"t":"text","text":"an unknown key does not compile — no silent "},{"t":"code","text":"order.totl"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"every locale has the "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"same keys with the same parameters"}]},{"t":"text","text":""}],[{"t":"text","text":"a translation you forgot is a compile error, not a fallback"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"parameters are "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"typed by their token"}]},{"t":"text","text":""}],[{"t":"text","text":"a date cannot be passed where a currency amount belongs"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"a plural carries "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"every category the locale requires"}]},{"t":"text","text":""}],[{"t":"text","text":"Polish needs "},{"t":"code","text":"one"},{"t":"text","text":"/"},{"t":"code","text":"few"},{"t":"text","text":"/"},{"t":"code","text":"many"},{"t":"text","text":"/"},{"t":"code","text":"other"},{"t":"text","text":"; French needs "},{"t":"code","text":"one"},{"t":"text","text":"/"},{"t":"code","text":"other"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"a DI-aware token declares its "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"CraftTS services"}]},{"t":"text","text":""}],[{"t":"text","text":"a missing provider is a compile error at the component/route boundary"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"a token declared with a "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"schema"}]},{"t":"text","text":" types its own input"}],[{"t":"text","text":"the call site passes what the schema parses, not what the formatter wants"}]]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The usual failure mode of a translation layer is that all of these are"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"runtime concerns: a missing key renders its own name, a wrong parameter renders"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"[object Object]"},{"t":"text","text":", and a missing plural category renders the wrong branch to the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"users of one locale only. None of that is observable from the code that calls"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"t"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"the-shape-of-it","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The shape of it"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"src/i18n/"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  catalog.ts          the reference locale — defineCatalog + msg + plural"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  locales/fr-FR.ts    every other locale — defineLocaleLike"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  project-tokens.ts   business tokens: defineToken / defineTokenFactory"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  runtime.ts          createI18nRuntime, and the reactive binding"}]}],"filename":"","language":"","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A key is its dotted path: "},{"t":"code","text":"order.total"},{"t":"text","text":" reaches"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"{ order: { total: msg"},{"t":"text","text":"…"},{"t":"code","text":" } }"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"where-to-go-next","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Where to go next"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/i18n/catalog","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"The catalogue"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — "},{"t":"code","text":"defineCatalog"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"msg"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"plural"},{"t":"text","text":","},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"defineLocale"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"defineLocaleLike"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/i18n/tokens","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Tokens"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — the shipped semantic tokens, and how to add your own."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/i18n/runtime","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"The runtime"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — "},{"t":"code","text":"createI18nRuntime"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"t"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"bind"},{"t":"text","text":", lazy locales."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/i18n/effect","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"With Effect"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — "},{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/i18n-effect"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Two checks belong in CI, and "},{"t":"code","text":"craft create"},{"t":"text","text":" wires both:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npm","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"run","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"i18n:check","kind":"string"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"npm","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"run","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"i18n:test","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"bash","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A working example lives in the demo, at "},{"t":"code","text":"apps/demo/src/app/examples/i18n/"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"guard-visible-text-in-craft-templates","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Guard visible text in Craft templates"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"craft create"},{"t":"text","text":" enables this preset for every project generated "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"with"}]},{"t":"text","text":" i18n —"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"its own pages already take their copy from the catalogue. A project generated"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"without i18n never sees the rule. To add it by hand to an existing application:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" craftRules "},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/dev-tools/eslint-rules'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"default","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" [","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    plugins: { ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'craft-ts'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": craftRules },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    rules: { ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"...","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"craftRules.configs.i18n.rules },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"];","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"js","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"craft-ts/require-i18n-text"},{"t":"text","text":" reports static text in visible headings,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"paragraphs, labels, buttons, links and options, plus visible "},{"t":"code","text":"placeholder"},{"t":"text","text":","},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"aria-label"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"title"},{"t":"text","text":" attributes — and it looks "},{"t":"em","children":[{"t":"text","text":"inside"}]},{"t":"text","text":" the visible"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"position, so "},{"t":"code","text":"p('Total: ' + t('cart.total'))"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"span(`Total: ${amount}`)"},{"t":"text","text":","},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"label(isNew ? 'New' : 'Returning')"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"p(name || 'Anonymous')"},{"t":"text","text":" and a literal in"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"a children array are reported too. Only what carries letters counts: "},{"t":"code","text":"first + ' ' + last"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"is glue between values, not copy. Dynamic business values, "},{"t":"code","text":"i18n.t(...)"},{"t":"text","text":", its"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"key and parameters, a generator child and catalogue files are accepted. Server files and tests are excluded so"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"technical messages and assertions can remain literal. The rule stays separate"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"from the recommended preset, because it only makes sense once the catalogue is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the application's source of truth — which is exactly the condition "},{"t":"code","text":"craft create"},{"t":"text","text":" checks when it decides to enable it."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"translation-parameters","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Translation parameters"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The complete visible sentence belongs to the catalogue. Do not translate one"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"piece and append another piece in the template: word order, punctuation and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"grammar can change between locales. "},{"t":"code","text":"craft-ts/no-i18n-composition"},{"t":"text","text":" reports this"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"pattern in visible text and attributes, including generator children."}]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"before-a-translated-fragment-followed-by-a-value","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Before: a translated fragment followed by a value"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"span","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" () {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"return","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"`${","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"i18n","kind":"function"},{"text":".","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"t","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'ui.space.expires'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":")","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"} ${","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"formatDate","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"string"},{"text":"item","kind":"function"},{"text":".","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"expiresAt","kind":"function"},{"text":"())","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"}`","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"This forces every locale to keep the same sentence shape and makes the date a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"second, untranslated fragment. With the i18n preset, ESLint reports:"}]},{"t":"quote","children":[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Do not compose translated text with other text or values. Put the complete"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"message in the i18n catalogue and pass dynamic values as translation"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"parameters."}]}]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"after-one-message-with-a-typed-parameter","children":[{"t":"text","text":"After: one message with a typed parameter"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Declare the value as a semantic token in the catalogue:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { dateLong, defineCatalog, msg } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/i18n'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"expiresAt"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"dateLong","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'expiresAt'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"catalog"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"defineCatalog","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  ui: {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    space: {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      expires: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"msg","kind":"function"},{"text":"`Space expires ${","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"expiresAt","kind":"string"},{"text":"}`","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Then pass the value to the translation in the template:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"span","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" () {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"return","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" i18n.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"t","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'ui.space.expires'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    expiresAt: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" item.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"expiresAt","kind":"function"},{"text":"(),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  });","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Each locale can now choose its own word order, punctuation and date placement,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"while the parameter remains typed and formatted through "},{"t":"code","text":"Intl"},{"t":"text","text":". For a custom"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"format, define a project token rather than rebuilding a translated sentence in"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the template; see "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/i18n/tokens","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Tokens"}]},{"t":"text","text":"."}]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"the-contract","text":"The contract"},{"level":2,"id":"the-shape-of-it","text":"The shape of it"},{"level":2,"id":"where-to-go-next","text":"Where to go next"},{"level":2,"id":"guard-visible-text-in-craft-templates","text":"Guard visible text in Craft templates"},{"level":2,"id":"translation-parameters","text":"Translation parameters"},{"level":3,"id":"before-a-translated-fragment-followed-by-a-value","text":"Before: a translated fragment followed by a value"},{"level":3,"id":"after-one-message-with-a-typed-parameter","text":"After: one message with a typed parameter"}]}